<<~ ahu slot=`#/body`>>

The browser vessel's lift, first whole capability: per-face custody under its own ward, and every tab its own session.

* b1-seal merged by hunk: the document store seals `change` and `checkpoint`; hydration checks the session's face; the browser island's rest and the holder seat follow; a faceless herm attaches its working floor through its place KEL; the floor catalog names public bags alone.
* The persona root rests under the per-face ward (`ward/h<N>/…`), owned by its face tree (`ward/h<N>/face-tree`); every ward act refuses a face other than the one worn (`ward-owned-by-another-face`); a face clear removes its ward rows; the face-key root door retired.
* Slice 4: the floor's port broker hands each follower tab its own MessagePort and never carries its traffic; each tab opens its own session and takes its own unlock; a dead tab's port ends its session, and the last session's close locks the house; the survivor becomes owner; frames reach every tab of the lit face, a control result reaches only its sender; a joining tab repaints the surface already showing.
* Weld tests pin the late-layer replay; the boot-order read measured the settle on a fold and refuted the hang.

Reads: blind Opus over the merge (P2s cured red-first) and again over the delta since. CI green at 2bbfb2413.

